    <string name="migration_instructions_content">Termux to CodeStudio Migration Guide\n====================================\n\nStep 1: Grant Storage Access in Termux\n--------------------------------------\nOpen Termux and run:\ntermux-setup-storage\n(Grant the storage permission popup on your screen).\n\nStep 2: Back Up Your Data in Termux\n-----------------------------------\nRun this exact command:\ntar -zcvf /sdcard/Download/termux-backup.tar.gz -C /data/data/com.termux/files ./home ./usr\n\nStep 3: Import in CodeStudio\n----------------------------\n1. Open CodeStudio.\n2. Go to Settings -> Termux Migration.\n3. Click \'Select and Import Backup\'.\n4. Select the \'termux-backup.tar.gz\' file from your Downloads folder.\n5. Wait for the import to complete and restart the app.\n\nNote: If you run into permission glitches after restore, simply restart your phone to sync system permissions.</string>
